# ZenSwitch profiles, one per line:
#
#   Name|/path/to/koreader
#       The profile uses its own KOReader copy; its settings and reading data live in it.
#
#   Name|/path/to/koreader|/path/to/data-folder
#       Several profiles share ONE KOReader install; each keeps its own settings,
#       reading progress, highlights, history and plugin data in its data folder
#       (KOReader's KO_HOME). Recommended: no duplicate installs, and updates apply to all.
#
# The first profile below just uses the default KOReader folder as its data folder.
# Names are what the launchers and the "Switch to …" menu show. Lines starting with # are ignored.
Alice|/mnt/us/koreader
Bob|/mnt/us/koreader|/mnt/us/zenswitch/profiles/Bob
